OpenPolyTrader End-to-End Event Flow (ASCII / ASC)
==================================================

External Inputs
---------------
[Gamma API] -------------------------> [MarketCatalogRefresher]
[Polymarket CLOB WS market channel] -> [MarketDataAgent]
[Polymarket CLOB WS user channel] ---> [ExecutionAgent fill/outcome tracking]
[Polymarket CLOB REST] --------------> [ExecutionAgent order submission/cancel]
[Polymarket Data API] ---------------> [PortfolioAgent reconciliation]

Core Runtime Flow
-----------------
[MarketCatalogRefresher]
  -> refreshes market pairs
  -> seeds [MarketAllowlist]

[MarketDataAgent]
  -- emits messageBus event: market:updated --> [Supervisor]

[Supervisor]
  -> forwards market update to [ScannerAgent]

[SignalAggregatorAgent] (optional web-search enrichment)
  -- emits messageBus event: learning:insight --> [ScannerAgent]

[LearningAgent] (optional synthesis path)
  -- emits messageBus event: learning:insight --> [ScannerAgent]

[ScannerAgent]
  -> evaluates near-zero/EV opportunity + gates
  -> requests global dependency-aware FW loop projection from [FwProjectionAgent]
  -> receives fw projection or fw basket opportunity candidate from [FwProjectionAgent]
  -- emits messageBus event: opportunity:detected --> [Supervisor]

[FwProjectionAgent]
  -> resolves dependency graph and runs fully-corrective FW loop (active set, gap, contraction)
  -> queries FW Oracle API via IpOracleClient each loop iteration
  -> returns fw_projection or fw_basket opportunity candidate to [ScannerAgent]

[Supervisor]
  -> re-checks gates with desired size
  -> requests risk sizing from [RiskAgent]
  -- emits messageBus event: risk:approved --> [Supervisor risk-approved handler]

[Supervisor risk-approved handler]
  -> invokes [ExecutionAgent.executeArbitrage|executeEvOrder|executeBasketArbitrage]

[ExecutionAgent]
  -> submits orders via Polymarket CLOB REST
  -> waits for user-channel fills/outcomes (live/near-zero path)
  -- emits messageBus event: execution:fill --> [PortfolioAgent]
  -- emits messageBus event: execution:outcome --> [Supervisor/Ops telemetry]

[PortfolioAgent]
  -> updates exposure + PnL snapshot
  -> reconciles against Polymarket Data API on cadence/incident

Telemetry + Ops Surfaces
------------------------
[All agents] -> [MetricsStore] -> [OpsAgent checks + alerts]
[All agents] -> [EventStore (SQLite)]
[MetricsStore + EventStore] -> [Fastify Ops API]
[Fastify Ops API] -> [/stream SSE + dashboard polling]
[Dashboard] -> operator actions (/config/*, /allowlist/:marketId/resume)

Primary Runtime Events (message bus)
------------------------------------
market:updated
opportunity:detected
risk:approved
execution:fill
execution:outcome
learning:insight
ops:health
ops:alert
ops:health_summary

Primary Ops API Events/Streams
------------------------------
GET /stream -> metric events such as:
- gate_rejection
- ev_signal
- fw_projection
- fw_basket
- fw_iteration
- fw_gap
- fw_active_set
- fw_contraction
- web_search
- risk
- order
- incident
- info
- metric_error
